    {
      "text": "So how to define LBH",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144205",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "The trend leader in innovative products for personal care appliances",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144439",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH Electric's entrepreneurial journey began in 2020. It is a technology company focusing on the design, development, manufacturing and sales of small personal care appliances with high-speed motor applications. We not only pursue the technological leadership of our products, but also pay more attention to design aesthetics and user experience, striving to make every product occupy a dominant position in the market. Since its establishment, LBH Electric has been leading the design trend and technological application innovation of personal care appliances, and is committed to creating the ultimate product experience - and will continue to do so in the future.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144438",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top brand partners",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144440",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "We have established strategic cooperative relationships with suppliers and make full use of supply chain advantages to provide customers with better services; LBH Electric has established long-term partnerships with many world-renowned brands. Looking to the future, LBH Electric always adheres to the concept of \"only by being at the forefront of the market can we gain unparalleled advantages\", which makes us the best partner for many brands.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144441",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "28px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH product certification",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144986",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "How are we different?",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144447",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Never stop pursuing excellence",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "title",
      "module": "module_724144442",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(220, 68, 5)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Never rest on your laurels, maintaining market leadership requires the best efforts of every member of our team. There’s no reason why we shouldn’t put in the extra effort when there’s an opportunity to do better.",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "content",
      "module": "module_724144442",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "12px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "18px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Be ready for any challenge",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "title",
      "module": "module_724144442",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "We face challenges every day. Challenges in life are unpredictable. All we can do is prepare ourselves mentally and emotionally. Whenever we encounter an obstacle, we need to use wisdom to break it down and then take action.",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "content",
      "module": "module_724144442",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "12px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "18px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "think and do new things",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "title",
      "module": "module_724144442",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "We know that there is no innovation and creativity without failure; exploring the unknown ocean requires not only a brave sailing team, but also the courage to explore the unknown coast; at LBH Electric, we value innovation and are willing to accept a process full of constructive conflicts.",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "content",
      "module": "module_724144442",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "12px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "18px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Focus to see the light",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "title",
      "module": "module_724144442",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "No one shoots at a target with their eyes closed. Whenever you want to achieve a goal, keep your eyes open, focus, and make sure you know what you want; focus on your target and focus like a laser beam. Ultimately, the things we focus on grow.",
      "tag": "DIV",
      "cls": "content",
      "module": "module_724144442",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "12px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "18px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH C",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144444",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "ore Value",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144444",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "40px",
