      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": ": Only by believing can you see",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144444",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "our mission",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144450",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Create a Platform for Outstanding Employees",
      "tag": "STRONG",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144504",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH Appliances is a company committed to fostering the growth of its employees and sharing opportunities for advancement; whenever an opportunity for professional development arises, we spare no effort to make it a reality.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144503",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Creating Value for Our Trusted Clients",
      "tag": "STRONG",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144505",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Customer interests take precedence over all else. LBH Appliances consistently views matters from the customer's perspective, continuously strives to enhance customer satisfaction, and is dedicated to building long-term, mutually trusting, and meaningful customer relationships.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144508",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Contributing to the advancement of the industry and society.",
      "tag": "STRONG",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144506",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "27px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "We are dedicated to continuously elevating industry standards for personal care and home appliances through daily innovation; our contributions include superior product experiences, advanced manufacturing technologies, and increased employment opportunities.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144509",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "14px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "21px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Listen to the Voice of the Customer",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144522",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "The high-speed hair dryer products LBH customized for us stand at the forefront of the industry in terms of both design and technical innovation. In the face of fierce market competition, and thanks to the product's unique differentiation and exceptional user experience, we rapidly secured a significant market share within a short period. The LBH team has fully delivered on the promises they made to us at the outset. Today, having successfully expanded into new domestic markets, our deep collaboration with LBH continues. We extend our sincere gratitude to the LBH team for their hard work and dedication.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724197386",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "12px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "—— Jeff Deng",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724197387",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH is the most efficient team we have ever collaborated with. From our initial meeting to the final product delivery, the entire process took just over two months—a feat that would have been unimaginable in the past! More importantly, the development process for the new product was expertly managed to successfully avoid any potential patent issues. Consumers absolutely love our product's aesthetic, and since its launch, it has received excellent feedback from the market. We look forward to continuing our partnership in the future to develop even more innovative products. The LBH team gives us complete peace of mind!",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724197390",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "12px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "—— Warren Steve",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724197392",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "30px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "The high-speed hair dryer products LHB customized for us stand at the forefront of the industry in terms of both design and technical innovation. In the face of fierce market competition, the products' unique differentiation and superior user experience enabled us to secure a significant market share within a very short period. The LHB team has fully delivered on the initial commitments they made to us. We have now successfully expanded into new international markets, and our deeper collaboration with LHB continues to evolve. We extend our sincere thanks to the LHB team for their hard work and dedication.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724197391",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "12px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
